      "statement": "Publishing is triggered only by a published GitHub release: publish.yml re-runs validation, typechecking, and tests, then upgrades npm to 11.21.1 before npm publish --provenance because Node 22's bundled npm 10 never attempts the OIDC trusted-publishing login and fails with a registry 404.",
